During the FSG JT Working Group meeting held on Tuesday 7/26, we decided 
that instead of having just JT working meetings that we would turn the JT 
working group meeting time into a general FSG OpenPrinting meeting to 
discuss Archtitecture, Job Ticketing, PAPI, or anything else that pertains 
to FSG OpenPrinting.

We will begin the new agenda on Tuesday August 16th. During this meeting 
we will decide how often we should hold the meetings and if the Tuesday 
time is okay for everyone who would like to participate. Following is the 
call in information:

Day: Tuesdays
Time: 
12:00-1:00 PM US Pacific time
1:00-2:00 PM US Mountain time
3:00-4:00 PM US Eastern time
9:00-10:00 PM Paris time
USA Toll Number: 1-484-630-2765
PASSCODE: 84974

Claudia Alimpich
